{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1447675-questions-on-the-cinder-isles","id":1447675,"title":"Questions on the Cinder Isles?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-05T18:11:51-07:00","id":1447675,"title":"Questions on the Cinder Isles?","content":"Hello all, I am working out a starting location and I am having trouble figuring out some stuff?<br /> <br /> 1) Where is the Cinder Isles?<br /> I want to players to be able to see where it is on the map, but I can't seem to see the Cinder Isles on the maps? Is it on the Lunar map, the core books, or the Dragon blooded?<br /> <br /> 2) Also anyone know which Great House has satraps in this area? I would like to know who controls this area in canon, I will likely just hand wave it as House Peleps but if I do that I want to have a back up reason why in case one of the books says otherwise?<br /> <br /> 3) Reserved for more dumb questions...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T18:49:07-07:00","id":1447679,"title":"","content":"1. Straight south from the Caul until it says \u201cCinder Isles\u201d all big.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T18:52:02-07:00","id":1447680,"title":"","content":"Ah thanks, I couldn't seem to find it on the Lunars map because it was on the core map. Arg to many maps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-07T02:18:34-07:00","id":1447781,"title":"","content":"Searching through the PDFs, there does not seem to be anything tying the area to a specifc Great House, but I do have some thoughts about nearby satrapies:<br /> <br /> Nearby An-Teng is described as a place for Dynasts to indulge with prostitutes (<b>Exalted</b>, p. 100; <b>What Fire Has Wrought</b>, p. 92) and a place from which House Cynis import narcotics (<b>What Fire Has Wrought</b>, p. 40), so I would definitely give An-Teng to House Cynis.<br /> <br /> House Ledaal would be my candidate for Lathe as it is plagued with demons and it is in route to both Faxai and An-Teng (<b>Exalted</b>, p. 101). The demon thing is a fit with House Ledaal due to the Shadow Crusade (<b>What Fire Has Wrought</b>, p. 44) while Faxai and An-Teng fit with House Ledaal because Arjuf is sending soldiers to the former (<b>What Fire Has Wrought</b>, p. 45) and merchant vessels to the latter (<b>The Realm</b>, p. 126). Finally, Lathe is interesting for you as it is the gateway to the Cinder Coast (<b>Exalted</b>, p. 101).<br /> <br /> As for the Cinder Isles themselves, I would go with House Peleps, but that is mostly due to the podcast <b>Fall of Jiara</b> saying that Peleps Maera has sailed there, and as far as I know that is not based directly in canon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":864,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","user":"Jutlander","date":".  Fixed a grammatical error. 05-07-2021, 07:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-07T06:47:53-07:00","id":1447807,"title":"","content":"I think there would be little to no Realm presence there. Great big archipelagoes are historically hard to control by a faraway empire. Mostly I think dynasts consider it little more than a distant backwater, something to dust off once the Caul is properly in the hands of the Scarlet Dynasty.<br /> <br /> Not to say that some explorers from the Realm are never seen, but they would be a pretty rare sight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-07T14:30:43-07:00","id":1447845,"title":"","content":"Canonically, Zhaojun and the Caul are the farthest extent of Realm control in the Southwest. The Cinder Isles are independent, and at least one Lunar (Lukha Palash) is active there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}